OL,4,G2000FThe Narrative Trap
OL,5,     GPhilosopher Julian Baggini
OL,6,     Gexplores how narratives shape our
OL,7,     Glives, our politics and our
OL,8,     Gidentities and how the stories we
OL,9,     Gtrust can mislead, divide, or
OL,10,     Gtrap us.
OL,11,G2100FHuman Intelligence
OL,12,     GWhat are the benefits of
OL,13,     Gperfectionism? How does a society
OL,14,     Gmanage to nurture thinkers who
OL,15,     Gseek perfection? And what price
OL,16,     Gdoes the search take from them
OL,17,     Gand for those around them?
